    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The Deeper the Generation, the Larger the Bias Can Grow | Generative Recommendation 2026·02: CARE</title>
      <link>https://chenhuiyu.github.io/blog/generative-recommendation-2026-02-care-en</link>
