      <dc:language>en</dc:language>
      <category>Generative Recommendation</category>
      <description>ContRec abandons discrete Semantic IDs, generates a continuous preference vector with diffusion, and retrieves a real catalog item afterward.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The Recommender Starts Generating the Product | Generative Recommendation 2026·04: DualFashion</title>
      <link>https://chenhuiyu.github.io/blog/generative-recommendation-2026-04-dualfashion-en</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://chenhuiyu.github.io/blog/generative-recommendation-2026-04-dualfashion-en</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:language>en</dc:language>
      <category>Generative Recommendation</category>
      <description>DualFashion uses image and text diffusion to generate a personalized fashion item plus a structured description, moving recommendation toward product design.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>One Next Item Is Not Enough: Generate the Whole Page | Generative Recommendation 2026·05: GenRec</title>
      <link>https://chenhuiyu.github.io/blog/generative-recommendation-2026-05-genrec-en</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://chenhuiyu.github.io/blog/generative-recommendation-2026-05-genrec-en</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:language>en</dc:language>
      <category>Generative Recommendation</category>
      <description>GenRec trains and generates at page level, compresses long histories with Token Merger, and aligns page preferences through GRPO-SR.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Generative Recommendation Enters the Advertising Mainline | Generative Recommendation 2026·06: GR4AD</title>
